5,1,1,talk,Shion,,We can't keep using the room for everything. It's inefficient and creates a mess. We need a formal purpose.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It feels like we're just guessing how to use it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"It's not fair! Whoever gets there first just takes it, and then someone else has to clean up.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is more than just a matter of cleaning, Rin. We have lost a space for genuine connection.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Regardless of the sentiment, the current lack of structure is wasting time. We should look at the data.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,I want to know exactly how the noise and the mess are affecting the office.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, if we look at data, can we see what we're spending on outside rooms?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually using the room the most!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,I am interested in how we communicate now that the room is in chaos.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the labor. I want to see where the maintenance hours are actually going.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,Let's just pick the lists and get it over with.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'll check the fridge too! That's where the mess starts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the nature of our recent conversations.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let's divide the research.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
