35,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The wall is basically paper. I can hear everything. Plus, people are eating at their desks, leaving crumbs everywhere.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We spent 68,000 yen last year on outside hires for tiny groups. A fit-out would be a one-time cost.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,Only two people are using the room almost all the time! And the old fridge was full of mystery junk.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,We only talk by the printer now. Our last difficult conversation happened in front of everyone. It was heartbreaking.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Most of us spend twenty-five minutes just getting lunch. The facilities logs show the store room is the only quiet spot.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, how much for the fit-outs? If it's cheap, we can move the noise and food out of the office.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The screen and table are 141,000 yen. The kitchen setup is 96,000. Both are cheaper than long-term rentals.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If it's a kitchen, who cleans it? I don't want to be the only one cleaning the mystery junk again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"A kitchen brings people together, but a meeting space allows for the privacy we desperately lack.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The time lost to lunch trips is a significant drain. A kitchen would recover those hours.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"A quiet room would solve the noise, but a meeting space solves the privacy and the ""printer talk.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm worried about who signs for the cost. But the outside hire invoices are a recurring leak.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just want a rule. If it's a meeting space, we can use a calendar so it's fair.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,Privacy is essential for the health of our relationships. We cannot grow as strangers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A meeting space requires less upkeep than a kitchen. No crumbs, no old food.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,"Logically, moving the noise and the food out of the main area is the priority.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think a professional meeting space is the most justifiable expense on paper.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"As long as there's a calendar, I'm happy. No more ""first come, first served.""","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I agree. We need a sanctuary for the difficult, necessary conversations.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Efficiency and low maintenance point toward the meeting space.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
