60,3,1,talk,Shion,,I vote for the Meeting Space. It removes the noise from my desk and the crumbs from the office.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. The cost is manageable compared to the hourly rentals we've been paying.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,Meeting Space for me! The calendar makes it fair for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,I support the Meeting Space. It provides the dignity and privacy our interactions require.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I will vote Meeting Space. It's the most time-efficient and lowest maintenance option.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,Is anyone actually considering the kitchen or the quiet room?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The kitchen is tempting for the cost, but the maintenance is a risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,I don't want to clean a kitchen!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room is too solitary. We need to talk, just not in public.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"The data on lunch trips is interesting, but the labor of a kitchen is a hidden cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shion,,It seems we are in total agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel better knowing the figures support this.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! No more fighting over the room!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,A wise choice for the harmony of the office.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It is the most logical conclusion.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
